Leo: Let''s try something healthier today. I''m taking charge of my diet.
Mia: Really? What are you going to order, then?
Leo: A salad with lots of colourful vegetables and some grilled chicken.
Mia: That does sound good. But I really want a soda.
Leo: Sugary drinks just add extra calories. Why not have water instead?
Mia: You''re right. I''ll have water and a fruit bowl.
Leo: Great choice. Half our plates are fruits and vegetables now!', 'Mia 饿了想点披萨和汽水;Leo 想吃更健康的,正在掌管自己的饮食;他打算点彩色蔬菜沙拉和烤鸡;Mia 想喝汽水;Leo 说含糖饮料只是多余热量,建议喝水;Mia 改点水和水果;两人盘子一半是水果蔬菜。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Mia first want to order?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Pizza and soda.","A green salad.","Grilled fish.","Only water."]},{"q":"Why is Leo choosing healthier food today?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["He has no money.","He is taking charge of his diet.","He dislikes pizza.","His doctor forced him."]},{"q":"What does Leo say about sugary drinks?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["They just add extra calories.","They are very cheap.","They taste of nothing.","They are good for sleep."]},{"q":"What does Mia decide to drink in the end?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Soda.","Water.","Sweet tea.","Juice."]},{"q":"What do their plates mostly contain by the end?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Cake and sweets.","Only meat.","Fruits and vegetables.","Nothing at all."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');
These super-agers often share a few simple habits.
They eat a plant-based diet and rarely eat until they are full.
They also get gentle exercise every single day.
Most importantly, they keep close friends to share their lives with.', '科学家对高龄仍健康的人很感兴趣;这些''超级老人''常有几个简单习惯;他们吃植物性饮食、很少吃到饱;每天都做轻柔运动;最重要的是,他们有亲密的朋友相伴。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Who are scientists interested in?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["People who never sleep.","Only young athletes.","People who eat fast food.","People who stay healthy at a very old age."]},{"q":"What kind of diet do super-agers eat?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A plant-based diet.","A meat-only diet.","No food at all.","Only sweet drinks."]},{"q":"How much do they usually eat?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["They always eat until very full.","They rarely eat until they are full.","They eat only once a week.","They never eat vegetables."]},{"q":"How often do they get gentle exercise?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Once a year.","Only on holidays.","Every single day.","Never."]},{"q":"What does the passage say is most important?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Earning a lot of money.","Living completely alone.","Watching television all day.","Keeping close friends to share life with."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');
Sam: Not really. And I never seem to have energy after class.
Anna: Have you tried exercising? It actually builds energy instead of using it up.
Sam: But I''m too tired to start.
Anna: Then come jogging with me. It''s more fun with a friend.
Sam: All right. Where should we go?
Anna: There''s a quiet park nearby. Let''s stretch first, then run slowly.
Sam: Sounds good. Maybe we can sign up for the charity run too.', 'Anna 见 Sam 疲惫,问他睡得够不够;Sam 课后总没精力;Anna 说运动其实能增加而非消耗精力;Sam 太累不想开始;Anna 邀他一起慢跑,有朋友更有趣;两人决定去附近安静的公园,先拉伸再慢跑;还打算报名慈善跑。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What problem does Sam have?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He has no energy after class.","He sleeps too much.","He dislikes his friends.","He exercises too hard."]},{"q":"What does Anna say about exercise?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It uses up all your energy.","It actually builds energy.","It is bad for tired people.","It only works in winter."]},{"q":"Why does Anna suggest jogging together?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["It is cheaper alone.","It is required by school.","It is more fun with a friend.","Sam has no choice."]},{"q":"What does Anna want to do before running?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Eat a big meal.","Take a long nap.","Buy new shoes.","Stretch first."]},{"q":"What might they sign up for?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A charity run.","A cooking class.","A music club.","A long sleep."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');
If you do not sleep enough, you may feel moody and easily annoyed.
Teenagers should try to get eight to ten hours each night.
A simple tip is to keep your phone in another room.
Stay motivated, and an early bedtime will soon become a habit.', '充足睡眠是保持健康最简单的方法之一;睡不够会让人情绪低落、易怒;青少年每晚应睡八到十小时;一个简单贴士是把手机放在别的房间;保持动力,早睡很快会成为习惯。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is one of the easiest ways to stay healthy?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Eating more sugar.","Getting enough sleep.","Skipping breakfast.","Watching TV late."]},{"q":"How might you feel without enough sleep?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Calm and happy.","Stronger than ever.","Moody and easily annoyed.","Completely fine."]},{"q":"How many hours should teenagers sleep each night?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Two to three hours.","As little as possible.","Exactly fourteen hours.","Eight to ten hours."]},{"q":"What simple tip does the passage give?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Keep your phone in another room.","Drink coffee before bed.","Study all night.","Play games in bed."]},{"q":"What will help an early bedtime become a habit?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Giving up at once.","Staying motivated.","Sleeping less.","Buying a new phone."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');
Ben: Maybe thirty seconds? I''m always in a hurry.
Dentist: That''s far too short. Proper brushing takes at least two minutes.
Ben: Two minutes? I never realised it should be that long.
Dentist: An electric brush with a timer could really help you.
Ben: Does it clean better than an ordinary one?
Dentist: Studies confirm it removes more of the soft film on your teeth.
Ben: Then I''ll get one. I want to protect my overall health.', '牙医问 Ben 平时刷牙多久;Ben 说大概三十秒,总是匆忙;牙医说太短,正确刷牙至少两分钟;Ben 没意识到要这么久;牙医建议用带计时器的电动牙刷;问能否刷得更干净;牙医说研究证实它能去除更多牙齿软膜;Ben 决定买一支,保护整体健康。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How long does Ben usually brush his teeth?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["About ten minutes.","A full hour.","About thirty seconds.","He never brushes."]},{"q":"How long should proper brushing take?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Five seconds.","Half a day.","Once a week is enough.","At least two minutes."]},{"q":"What does the dentist suggest Ben use?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["An electric brush with a timer.","A bigger cup.","A toothpick only.","No brush at all."]},{"q":"What do studies confirm about that brush?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["It costs less money.","It removes more of the soft film.","It is harder to hold.","It works only at night."]},{"q":"Why does Ben decide to buy one?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["To win a prize.","Because it is cheap.","To protect his overall health.","Because his friend told him to."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');
These places are known as the Blue Zones.
People there eat lots of vegetables and move their bodies every day.
They also keep a low-stress life with family and friends.
None of their habits is hard, but together they make a big difference.', '在少数特别的地方,人们比别处活得更久更健康;这些地方被称为蓝区;那里的人吃很多蔬菜、每天活动身体;还和家人朋友过着低压力的生活;他们的习惯都不难,但合在一起作用很大。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is special about these few places?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["No one ever eats vegetables.","People never see friends.","It is always very cold.","People live longer and more healthily."]},{"q":"What are these places called?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The Blue Zones.","The Red Lines.","The Green Hills.","The Grey Towns."]},{"q":"How often do people there move their bodies?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Once a month.","Every day.","Only on weekends.","Almost never."]},{"q":"What kind of life do they keep?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["A busy, lonely life.","A high-stress life.","A low-stress life with family and friends.","A life with no friends."]},{"q":"What does the passage say about their habits?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Each one is very difficult.","They have no effect at all.","Only the rich can follow them.","None is hard, but together they make a big difference."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required3', 'U3', 'sufe');

